     N'The SIMAH report shows a current default (90+ days past due, write-off or legal recovery): capped at Caa3'),
    ('BUREAU_DPD90_12M', 'STANDALONE', 0, 'B3', NULL, 'ALWAYS', N'تأخر 90 يومًا فأكثر خلال سنة',
